    {
      "fileName": "arcane-slam.json",
      "id": "xfbPSP9tl1N95xDF",
      "name": "Arcane Slam",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "xfbPSP9tl1N95xDF",
        "folder": "6ZNOJCnImnivuJJN",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Arcane Slam",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained].</p><hr /><p>You channel magical power from your core into your arm, empowering your attack as you attempt to slam your foe into the ground. Attempt an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.action-macros.Macro.Athletics: Arcane Slam]{Athletics} check against the foe's Fortitude DC. You take a –2 circumstance penalty to your check if the target is one size larger than you and a –4 circumstance penalty if it's larger than that. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your check if the target is one size smaller than you and a +4 circumstance bonus if it's smaller than that.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You slam the foe down and the magical energy overwhelms it. The creature is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round, and takes damage equal to 2d6 plus your Strength modifier. The foe is no longer @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] by you.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You slam the foe down. The creature is knocked prone and takes damage equal to your Strength modifier. The foe is no longer grabbed or restrained by you.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You are unable to slam the creature, but your hold on the creature remains.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature breaks free and is no longer grabbed or restrained by you.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhancement</strong> Your arms better channel your core's power. You no longer take penalties for attempting to slam larger foes. Your foe takes damage equal to 2d6 plus your Strength modifier on a success (or double that on a critical success).</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 9
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "warrior automaton"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Guns & Gears"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "add",
              "path": "flags.system.automaton.enhancements.greater",
              "value": {
                "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Automaton.EnhanceableFeats.ArcaneSlam",
                "value": "arcane-slam"
              }
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "automaton"
            ]
          }
        },
